# mjolnir/.env — ONLY values used by mjolnir and nothing else.
#
# Shared values live in the repository root `.env` (see /.env.example):
# TUN_SITE_ADDRESS, TUN_PUBLIC_BASE, OTA_TOKEN, OPERATOR_AUTH_TOKEN,
# MJOLNIR_POSTGRES_PASSWORD (renamed from POSTGRES_PASSWORD by D151 — one key
# per database, and backup/entrypoint.sh reads it by the new name),
# INTERNAL_TOKEN, BACKUP_*. Do not repeat any of them here — no value is
# defined in two files.
#
# Derived values are computed in compose.yaml and typed nowhere:
# DATABASE_URL and STABBUR_BASE_URL (http://stabbur-backend:5056).
# STABBUR_UI_BASE is gone entirely (unified-auth 5.4): stabbur's UI moved to
# the prefix root, and hub derives `$TUN_PUBLIC_BASE/stabbur/` itself.
# The old *_UPSTREAM keys are
# gone entirely — caddy/Caddyfile names stabbur-backend, smia-backend and
# phonexa-backend directly, because one repository is one Compose project
# with one default network and a service name always resolves. There is no
# `tun-shared` network and no `docker network create` step.

# --- the operator gate --------------------------------------------------
# NOTHING TO SET HERE ANY MORE. This section used to hold
# PHONEXA_AUTH_HASH, a bcrypt hash generated by hand with
# `caddy hash-password` and single-quoted so compose would not eat its `$`s.
#
# unified-auth 3.2/3.3 deleted it. The gateway derives the hash from the root
# .env's OPERATOR_AUTH_TOKEN at container start (grind/entrypoint.sh) and
# every operator zone — /mjolnir, /builder, /stabbur, /smia, /phonexa,
# /shadow and /adminer — is gated by the one `(operator_gate)` snippet in
# grind/caddy/Caddyfile that reads it. Username is fixed to `operator`; the
# password is OPERATOR_AUTH_TOKEN itself.
#
# Rotation is now one value: change OPERATOR_AUTH_TOKEN and restart. There is
# no second thing to keep in step, which is what P35 and P36 both were.
#
# Note the operator zones share one origin with hub and builder, whose
# session cookie is Path=/. HttpOnly stops other-zone JS from reading it; it
# does not stop the browser sending it. Accepted when the operator chose
# paths over subdomains.

# --- hub / builder ------------------------------------------------------
# Source language for bundle/forecast work. Defaults to "no".
# SOURCE_LANG=no

# --- local/dev only — never set either on the VPS -----------------------
# ALLOW_HTTP=1
# ALLOW_NO_COMPANION=1
